{
  "about": "The corpus the sweep reads: each source pinned by repository and full commit. `checkout` says what of the commit is checked out: `whole`, a `cone` of folders, sparse `patterns` (non-cone), or a list of `files`. `documents` says which files in the checkout are documents: those under one of `roots` whose path relative to the checkout matches `match`. `files` is the number of such files, and `distinct` the number left once a file identical (by SHA-1) to one in an earlier source, or earlier in this one by path, is counted once. fetch.cjs fails if either differs.",
